    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so tiring. trying to pretend like anything matters when you realize the whole structure was a lie. it's like you're just waiting for something to happen, but you know nothing will. i feel like i'm just taking up space in a world that doesn't actually have a point. if there's no foundation, why even bother holding everything up? why keep struggling against the void?",
